{"id":"wb-6-551","name":"安城城墙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"安吉城墙","text":"安吉城墙又名安城城墙、桃城，为旧安吉县城、安吉州城城墙，位于今中国浙江省湖州市安吉县城区以北、递铺街道安城村，是浙江地区保存最完整的古代州、县级城墙。1989年公布为第四批浙江省文物保护单位，2006年公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%89%E5%90%89%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99","revisionId":89473196,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89473196","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8d4d18bc4ba9c9b8fc0b774b.jpg","title":"City_wall_of_Anji_between_Baocheng_Gate_and_Chaoyang_Gate_11_2019-01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:City_wall_of_Anji_between_Baocheng_Gate_and_Chaoyang_Gate_11_2019-01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/City_wall_of_Anji_between_Baocheng_Gate_and_Chaoyang_Gate_11_2019-01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​安吉城墙西门宝城门与南门朝阳门之间的墙段，自城外看。","width":320,"height":213}}